### Alle ShoppingLists
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist

###

### ShoppingList nach ID
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist/4

###

### Items einer ShoppingList
GET http://localhost:8080/shoppinglist/4/items

###

### Item erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/item
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shampoo",
  "category": "Drogerie",
  "amount": "1 Stück",
  "shop": "DM",
  "url": "",
  "price": 2.99,
  "priority": "Mittel",
  "status": "Offen",
  "purchased": false,
  "shoppingList": {
    "id": 4
  }
}

###

### User erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "auth0|testuser1",
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "name": "Test User 1"
}